# T05 replay script (Predator tutorial: Shrine menu, upgrades, skull, gather, cloak, ambush, heal, Thermal Vision, scroll).
# Plays all 24 goals; g22 (scroll) done by frame ~5980, the last goal (g23, a ~600 frame message timer) ends at ~6580.
# Pad polls, B+n = n polls after the briefing; frame is about B+n+844. Model as t04.pad: LS pans the camera, the cursor sits
# at the screen centre, ground point (cam x, cam y - 21.4); ldown raises y, lup lowers it. Goals gate on game time, keep gaps.
# Menus are rebuilt on every open: an upgrade is only offered if it was enabled BEFORE the menu opened.
# close the mission briefing
B+60 start
# skip the intro movie
B+150 a
# g0 select the Shrine (cursor starts on it)
B+250 a
# g1 Black opens the Shrine menu
B+330 black
# g2 order Predators (A, A) and confirm with X
B+420 a
B+470 a
B+540 x
# g3/g4 reselect the Shrine, reopen the menu
B+600 a
B+680 black
# g5 upgrade the Brawler: right, A ("No"), left ("Yes"), A
B+760 right
B+840 a
B+920 left
B+1000 a
# g6 Black exits the menu
B+1080 black
# g7 select the Predator Gun at (105,80)
B+1100 lright:20
B+1140 ldown:15
B+1190 a
# g8 Black deploys it
B+1250 black
# g9 select the Blooded SpearMaster at (103,48)
B+1310 lleft:13
B+1350 lup:56
B+1450 a
# g10 kill the Marine at (115,48): B on the hovered Marine
B+1500 lright:33
B+1560 b
# g11/g12 acquire the skull: corpse hover window is pointer y in [47.1,48.4] at x=115.56
B+1790 ldown:8
B+1840 b
# g13 hold RT and press Y (focus Gather), then A with RT held (places the gather order)
B+2110 rt+y:8
B+2118 rt+a:8
# g14 Black cloaks the predator
B+2200 black
# g15 ambush the two Marines at (100,22): pan the cursor onto them, B attacks
B+2300 lleft:37
B+2360 lup:48
B+2520 b
# g16 walk back to the Shrine (within 4 of (100.6,77.4)): pan down, B moves
B+2950 ldown:80
B+3070 b
# g17 stand until energy is full (wait ~720 frames)
# g18 hold LT, Black (focus heal), A
B+4150 lt:10
B+4160 lt+black:8
B+4168 lt+a:8
# g19 select the Shrine (cursor onto it), Black opens the menu
B+4320 lright:1
B+4350 ldown:15
B+4400 a
B+4450 black
# g20 Thermal Vision: close and reopen the menu so the upgrade is offered, right, down (Thermal), A, left (Yes), A
B+4520 black
B+4590 black
B+4650 right
B+4700 down
B+4750 a
B+4800 left
B+4850 a
# g21 Black exits the menu
B+4920 black
# g22 scroll the camera to the marked position (32,126) within LookRadius 7
B+4960 lleft+ldown:75
B+5060 lleft:42
